\newlabel{tab:main}{{1}{5}{Held-out performance by training budget. Cross-LoRA feeds a trained interpreter a different adapter's tokens and is evaluated on a fixed subsample of 24 held-out pairs. Retrieval rank is the normalized rank of the true concept, where 0.5 is chance and lower is better. Chance accuracy is 0.0065}{table.1}{}}
